  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Combine Wagyu, Khao Khua, and a pinch of Fleur de sel in a bowl.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix Gruyère, Mascarpone, Champagne vinegar, and a pinch of black pepper.",
    "Add the wet mixture to the dry mixture and mix until just combined.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a greased Mason jar.",
    "Tighten the Mason jar lid and bake for 10 minutes.",
    "Let cool for 2 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve warm, garnished with Fleur de sel if desired."
